msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of <if ($gn68 == 19)><if ($gn72 >= 94)>{540}<else><if ($gn68 == 19)><if ($gn72 >= 84)>{440}<else>{400}</if><else>{400}</if></if><else><if ($gn68 == 19)><if ($gn72 >= 84)>{440}<else>{400}</if><else>{400}</if></if>.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Restores MP<br>Can only be executed while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Sepulchre Ready</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br><br>※This action cannot be assigned to a hotbar.<br>※<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Supplication</ui-edge-color></ui-color> changes to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Sepulchre</ui-edge-color></ui-color> when requirements for execution are met."
