msgid "Delivers an attack with a potency of 240.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Increases <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Kenki Gauge</ui-edge-color></ui-color> by 5"
