msgid "Restores own HP and the HP of all nearby party members.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Cure Potency: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>500<br>Can only be executed while under the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Refulgent Lux</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
